<</A 23091 0 R /Alt(Figure 4.5: 2 to 4 decoder: \(a\) Truth table; \(b\) Circuit to realize output O0; \(c\) Complete circuit. The circuit in b has a 3-input AND gate with inputs E, I1 passed through a NOT gate, and I0 passed through a NOT gate. Its output is O0. The circuit in C has four 3-input AND gates. Each has E as one of its inputs. The other two inputs are I1' and I0'; I1' and I0' I1 and I0'; and I1 and I0. The outputs of the AND gates are O0, O1, O2, and O3, respectively.␀)/K 0/P 31 0 R /Pg 15297 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
