<</A 23103 0 R /Alt(Figure 4.7 BCD to 7-segment decoder: \(a\) Truth table; \(b\) Karnaugh Map for segment a; \(c\) Circuit for segment a. The Karnaugh map has circles around the following groups of terms: I3'I2'I1'I0', I3'I2'I1I0', I3I2'I1'I0', and I3I2'I1I0'; I3'I2I1'I0, I3'I2I1I0, I3I2I1'I0, and I3I2I1I0; all terms with I3=1; and all terms with I1=1. The circuit in C has a 4-input OR gate with output a. Its inputs are I3, I1, the output of a 2-input AND gate which has inputs I2 and I0; and the output of a 2-input AND gate which has inputs I2 passed through a NOT gate and I0 passed through a NOT gate.␀)/K 144/P 31 0 R /Pg 15299 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
