7164 0 obj
<</A 23258 0 R /Alt(Figure 4.31: 4-bit carry-lookahead adder. For i=0,1,2,3, Ai and Bi are ANDed to form gi, and Ai and Bi are ORed to form pi. S0 is the output of a 3-input XOR gate with inputs Cin, B0, and A0. S1 is the XOR of g1, p1, and c0. C0 is the output of an OR gate with inputs A0 and the AND of B0 and Cin. S2 is the XOR of g2, p2, and the OR of g1 and the AND of c0 and p1. S3 is the XOR of g3, p3, and the OR of g2 and the AND of c1 and p2. Carry out is the OR of g3 and the AND of p3 and c2.␀)/K 9/P 31 0 R /Pg 15091 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
