<</A 19943 0 R /Alt(Figure 8.17: Karnaugh maps for the next state and output functions for the Mealy machine. The map for NS1 has a circle encompassing I-PS1-PS0 = 101\(1\) and 111\(X\), and around 011\(X\) and 010\(1\). The map for NS0 has a circle around 001\(1\) and 011\(X\), and around the single term 100\(1\). The map for \) has a single circle around terms 111\(X\) and 110\(1\).␀)/K 17/P 36 0 R /Pg 19299 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
10871 0 obj
<</A 19944 0 R /Alt(Figure 8.18 Combinatorial logic circuits to generate the next state and output for the Mealy machine. The circuit for NS1 has two 2-input AND gates with inputs PS0 and I, and PS1 and I passed through a NOT gate. The outputs of the two AND gates are input to a 2-input OR gate that outputs NS1. The circuit for NS0 has two 2-input AND gates with inputs PS0 and I passed through a NOT gate, and PS1 passed through a NOT gate and PS0 passed through a NOT gate. The outputs of the two AND gates are input to a 2-input OR gate that outputs NS0. The circuit to generate O is a single 2-input AND gate with inputs PS1 and I and output O.␀)/K 18/P 36 0 R /Pg 19299 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
