11609 0 obj
<</A 20036 0 R /Alt(Figure 8.35: Circuit for the 3-bit Gray code sequence generator using a lookup ROM. Outputs D5, D4, and D3 of the ROM are connected to data inputs D2, D1, and D0 of the register. ROM outputs D2, D1, and D0 supply system outputs O2, O1, and O0. Outputs Q2, Q1, and Q0 of the register are connected to address inputs A3, A2, and A1 of the ROM. System input I is connected to ROM adddress input A0. CLK is connected to the clock input of the register.␀)/K 34/P 36 0 R /Pg 19310 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
