12846 0 obj
<</A 26018 0 R /Alt(Figure 9.2: Asynchronous sequential circuit: the partial S-R latch: \(a\) Logic diagram; \(b\) Redrawn to incorporate delay and feedback. The circuit in a is the S-R latch constructed from NOR gates shown earlier in this book. The circuit in b shows a NOR gate with inputs S and q. Its output and R are input to a second NOR gate. The output of that gate is labeled Q and is passed back to a box labeled with the Greek letter delta. The output of this box is q.␀)/K 17/P 38 0 R /Pg 19107 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
