12954 0 obj
<</A 26035 0 R /Alt(Figure 9.7: Primitive state diagram for the S-R latch. Transient states are shown in red. This diagram has eight states. State a has a self arc labeled 00/0, an arc to c labeled 01/0, and an arc to e labeled 10/0. State b has a self-arc labeled 00/1, an arc to d labeled 01/1, and an arc to f labeled 10/1. State c has a self arc labeled 01/0, an arc to a labeled 00/0, and an arc to g labeled 11/0. State d has an arc to c labeled 01/1; this state is shown in red. State e has an arc to f labeled 10/0; this state is shown in red. State f has a self arc labeled 10/1, an arc to b labeled 00/1, and an arc to h labeled 11/1. State g has a self arc labeled 11/0, an arc to c labeled 01/0, and an arc to e labeled 10/0. State h has an arc to g labeled 11/1; this state is shown in red.␀)/K 21/P 38 0 R /Pg 19110 0 R /S/Figure/T()>>
endobj
